# Licenses for ros-mobile-robots.com

## Documentation

Except where a page, file or credit specifies other terms, the original
documentation text and illustrations for ros-mobile-robots.com are licensed
under the [Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International license](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/).
See [LICENSE.text](LICENSE.text) for the full terms. Illustrations include
original figures generated for the documentation.

## Software

Except where a file or credit specifies other terms, original code written
for this repository is licensed under the [BSD 3-Clause License](LICENSE.code).
This includes code examples and
snippets written for the documentation, figure-generation scripts, tests,
build hooks and macros, the site's own theme JavaScript for interactive
figures, and the project's CI workflows.

## Other material

Third-party images, parts, software and quoted or included code retain
their respective terms. Consult the credit, file header or upstream notice
for each item and preserve the required notices when redistributing it.
The wiring diagrams and sketches in `docs/fritzing/` incorporate separately
licensed part artwork. Reuse of a complete diagram or sketch is subject to
the rights in both the layout and the included artwork.
Remo STL files distributed separately through Gumroad or Remo Insiders are
outside the scope of these repository licenses.
